nt elementor-clearfix elementor-active\"><p>Online scams and fraudulent activities have become increasingly prevalent in recent years. According to various reports and studies, billions of dollars are lost annually to cybercriminals who employ sophisticated tactics to deceive and exploit unsuspecting individuals and businesses.<\/p><\/div><\/div><div class=\"elementor-toggle-item\"><div class=\"elementor-tab-title\">\u00a0<\/div><\/div>                        <\/div>\n\n                    <\/div>\n\n                <\/div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-1-ce17653\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-35c8fe469343e285c166\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-35c8fe469343e285c166\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-35c8fe469343e285c166\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">What is the role of private investigators in combating cybercrime?<\/span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 17\" fill=\"none\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M7.19995 16.5V0.5H8.79995V16.5H7.19995Z\" fill=\"#3D3D3D\"><\/path><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M-2.08616e-07 7.69995L16 7.69995L16 9.29995L-2.78554e-07 9.29995L-2.08616e-07 7.69995Z\" fill=\"#3D3D3D\"><\/path><\/svg>                                    <\/div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                    