ekit-accordion-title\">What can individuals and businesses do to protect themselves from online scams?<\/span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 17\" fill=\"none\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M7.19995 16.5V0.5H8.79995V16.5H7.19995Z\" fill=\"#3D3D3D\"><\/path><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M-2.08616e-07 7.69995L16 7.69995L16 9.29995L-2.78554e-07 9.29995L-2.08616e-07 7.69995Z\" fill=\"#3D3D3D\"><\/path><\/svg>                                    <\/div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"3\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 3\" fill=\"none\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M-2.08616e-07 0.499999L16 0.5L16 2.5L-2.78554e-07 2.5L-2.08616e-07 0.499999Z\" fill=\"#675AFE\"><\/path><\/svg>                                    <\/div>\n                                <\/div>\n\n                            \n                                                    <\/a>\n                    <\/div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-c29457c69343e285c166\" class=\" collapse\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-2-ce17653\" data-parent=\"#accordion-69343e285c166\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <div class=\"elementor-toggle-item\"><div class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix elementor-active\"><p>To protect themselves from online scams, individuals and businesses should prioritize cybersecurity measures such as using strong and unique passwords, regularly updating software and antivirus programs, and being cautious with sharing personal or financial information online. Additionally, staying informed about common scam techniques, educating employees, and implementing robust security protocols can significantly reduce the risk of falling victim to cybercrime.<\/p><\/div><\/div>                        <\/div>\n\n                    <\/div>\n\n                <\/div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-3-ce17653\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-d3ebf8b69343e285c166\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-d3ebf8b69343e285c166\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-d3ebf8b69343e285c166\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">Are there any emerging trends in cybercrime that individuals and businesses should be aware of?<\/span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 17\" fill=\"none\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M7.19995 16.5V0.5H8.79995V16.5H7.19995Z\" fill=\"#3D3D3D\"><\/path><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M-2.08616e-07 7.69995L16 7.69995L16 9.29995L-2.78554e-07 9.29995L-2.08616e-07 7.69995Z\" fill=\"#3D3D3D\"><\/path><\/svg>                                    <\/div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n\t\t\t